# Database Schema

## Основные таблицы
- users
- profiles
- programs
- program_weeks
- workouts
- workout_exercises
- exercises
- exercise_media
- user_workout_logs
- user_progress
- user_measurements
- nutrition_plans
- user_nutrition_targets
- messages
- subscriptions

## Связи
- users -> profiles = 1:1
- programs -> program_weeks = 1:N
- program_weeks -> workouts = 1:N
- workouts -> workout_exercises = 1:N
- users -> user_workout_logs = 1:N
- users -> user_progress = 1:N
- users -> user_measurements = 1:N
